sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant W as Rust web API / RunStore
  participant R as Rig / bounded transport
  participant O as OpenAI
  participant I as Local search index
  B->>W: POST /api/runs (question, language, method)
  W->>W: Check session and limits; begin pending run
  W-->>B: Run ID
  loop At most 5 model attempts / 4 searches
    R->>R: Reserve persistent attempt
    R->>O: Count complete input
    O-->>R: Input count (must be 1..300,000)
    R->>O: Generate with original payload
    O-->>R: Search request or final structured answer
    opt Model requests a search
      R->>I: Direct callback (query, top_k, fixed method)
      I-->>R: Exact sections, source IDs and dates
    end
  end
  R->>R: Validate quotes against retrieved sections
  R-->>W: Validated answer and searches, or error
  W->>W: Complete run in RAM
  B->>W: GET /api/runs/{id}
  W-->>B: Answer, citations and search trace, or error
